181 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We observed that BART slightly performed better than other model in all evaluation metrics because BART is denoising autoencoder which directly improves its text regeneration ability. It is also a extractive type model which benefits ROUGE. Bart was trained on CNN/Dailymail dataset which is extractive type dataset. Model size also contribute to richer output. Moreover T5 and Pegasus are tend to abstractive which falls out when using ROUGE metric)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
